{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find A Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Bargan's Treasure,&quot; the player embarks on an adventure to restore a once-thriving village. After a disaster cut off power and water, the villagers fled, leaving puzzles in their wake. Your mission is to solve these puzzles, bring the villagers home, and revive the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/1.png?t=1742981433\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Embark On A Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a rich, hand-painted world, overcoming platforming challenges and solving puzzles. As you explore, overcome obstacles, discover hidden clues, and collect essential objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/3__1_.png?t=1742981433\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover A Magical World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stunning landscapes filled with lost villagers, ancient secrets, and ancient ruins. Each puzzle you solve revitalizes part of the village and unravels the deeper story of Bargan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/2__1_.png?t=1742981433\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Restore Bargan's Treasure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve intricate puzzles to restore the village's infrastructure, guiding each villager home. With each villager helped, you bring hope and prosperity back to the region, paving the way for a brighter future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/4__1_.png?t=1742981433\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3133210?t=1742981433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/3fdd066dd450248b53742542f90a9194856f98af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742981433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/0da93e39aedbe8b6889743d92a67d764eface627/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742981433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/0da93e39aedbe8b6889743d92a67d764eface627/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742981433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find A Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Bargan's Treasure,&quot; the player embarks on an adventure to restore a once-thriving village. After a disaster cut off power and water, the villagers fled, leaving puzzles in their wake. Your mission is to solve these puzzles, bring the villagers home, and revive the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/1.png?t=1742981433\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Embark On A Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a rich, hand-painted world, overcoming platforming challenges and solving puzzles. As you explore, overcome obstacles, discover hidden clues, and collect essential objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133210/extras/3__1_.